'''Mayke Almodovar''' ({{Langx|mxi|مايكه ألمودوبار|Mayke Almođóbar}}; 29 August 1859 – 8 April 1929) was the sixth [[President of the Baliscan Confederation|President of Balisca]] and the second to be appointed after the adoption of the [[1883 Confederal Convention|1883 Baliscan Constitution]]. Presiding from 1893 to 1903, he became Balisca's first [[W:Head of state|head of state]] of [[Afro-Baliscans|Afro-Baliscan]] descent. 

